				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "When a save fails to compile, GT pops a notification card naming the offending module, the function the cursor was in, the line, and the first line of the error.  Click **Open** and a fresh module coder spawns, focused on the function that broke."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "elementSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
