					"uidString" : "E0T6/iFXWfXiX9T8pTdp9g=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Three pieces of information drive the focus on Open:\n\n1. **Module name** — the file the parser actually rejected, not necessarily the file you were saving.  When a save in `Foo` triggers a recompile that fails on a sibling `Bar`, the notification names `Bar`.\n2. **Function + arity** — the enclosing `def`, found by looking up the error line in the cached function entries from the most recent successful compile.\n3. **Line** — used as a Source-tab scroll target when the function-tab focus doesn't apply."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
